{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:The positional derivation in SRC_005 shares mechanism with SRC_004, as both resolve the combinatorial space by splitting on the inclusion of zero to handle the asymmetry of the hundreds digit. This shared mechanism is refuted if the zero-inclusion case yields a count other than 144, breaking the 144+504 partition into 648.","id":"efd782f0a97e6e253e6ecd1bc399a54ae86efdb16ba23323fe0675f6207460fe","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@ebda2ebd3191","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"05ae27a040f06751cfcdbdec56b62dc1f42ba2b7e6ba91a5d62be04fed96cdb1"},{"role":"dependence","target":"5e95e316347671c66500aa676df03f364a5b2788b06682156122bd491bfa8d96"},{"role":"dependence","target":"71d410c6850fc4697f217e11217c546541e8e397e78cf0ee2b790eb11dc01a00"},{"role":"dependence","target":"76b7be6b2776c0de395be0bf2c48430eac44471502db1779f9ea2719ccdf26f1"},{"role":"dependence","target":"bcfbcf393cf54f6ac70a939b904adcaa533dafbcd4d4b7f43a3992793e1d967f"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":468,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-0"},"warrants":[]},"id":"efd782f0a97e6e253e6ecd1bc399a54ae86efdb16ba23323fe0675f6207460fe","schema":"artifact"}